    54  | 32   | reverse  | 0.26        | 19.53       | 76.0x | Yes        |
    55  | 32   | duplicates| 0.34       | 8.67        | 25.6x | Yes        |
    56  | 64   | random   | 0.80        | 38.26       | 48.0x | Yes        |
